## 7. Common Mistakes

❌ Returning the numbers instead of their indices.

❌ Starting the inner loop from `j = 0`, causing duplicate comparisons.

❌ Using `return nums` instead of returning the two indices.

❌ Forgetting to return an integer array.

❌ Adding all array elements instead of checking pairs.

